<topic id = "AENLSB0A3116004013" page = "2">
<title>
Wheel side joint
</title>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
For left side drive shaft, install boot and boot band according to the following procedure.
</ptxt>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Wash disassembled parts (except boots). After washing parts, air-dry them completely.
</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Clean boots with shop cloth.
</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Apply grease from the service kit to wheel side joint.
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Grease specification for front drive shaft wheel side joint
</title>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1" page = "2">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "1.614in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.807in"/>
<thead>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
Grease color
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
Grease amount
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle" align = "center">
<ptxt>
Tan
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
85 – 105 g
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(3.00 – 3.70 oz)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Install wheel side boot on shaft.
</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Insert flat-bladed screwdriver or the like into boot (1) and allow air to enter boot so that air pressure in boot becomes the same as atmospheric pressure at boot fixing position.
</ptxt>
<figure page = "2">
<graphic graphicname = "IFRA0A311007.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "33.841mm" ver = "01" gw = "152" gh = "79"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Place new boot big band (3) and small band (4) onto boot putting each band outer end (1) against forward rotation (2) as shown in figure.
</ptxt>
<figure page = "2">
<graphic graphicname = "I4RS0A310009.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "91.005mm" ver = "01" gw = "135" gh = "241"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Fasten boot bands (1) using special tool as shown in figure.
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
Squeezing or distorting the boot will reduce its durability.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Do not force air out of the boot by squeezing or distorting it when fastening it with boot bands.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
<servicetool>
<servicetoolitem id = "L3A101">
<s-part>
(A)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09943-57011">
09943–57011
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
</servicetool>
<spec>
<title>
Boot band fastening distance
</title>
<ptxt>
“a”: 1.2 – 4.0 mm (0.04 – 0.15 in.)
</ptxt>
</spec>
<figure page = "2">
<graphic graphicname = "IFKA0P311008.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "51.326mm" ver = "02" gw = "186" gh = "129"/>
</figure>
</s2>
</s1>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
For right side drive shaft, install damper to specified position on shaft as shown in figure.
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Drive shaft damper installing position
</title>
<ptxt>
“a”: 309 – 313 mm (12.2 – 12.3 in.)
</ptxt>
</spec>
<figure page = "2">
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A311010.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "45.861mm" ver = "02" gw = "233" gh = "113"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[A]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Wheel side
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0A3116004014" page = "2">
<title>
Differential side joint
</title>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
Wash disassembled parts (except boot and tripod joint). After washing parts, air-dry them completely.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Clean boot and tripod joint with shop cloth.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
For right side drive shaft, install drive shaft support bracket (1) and washer (2) to differential side joint housing and tighten drive shaft support bracket washer bolt (3) to specified torque, if removed.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T3A103">
<t-part>
Drive shaft support bracket washer bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
7.5
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
0.76
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
5.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure page = "2">
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A311011.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "75.427mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "197"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Place new boot big band (3) and small band (4) onto boot putting each band outer end (1) against forward rotation (2) as shown in figure.
</ptxt>
<figure page = "2">
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A311013.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "43.169mm" ver = "01" gw = "209" gh = "105"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install differential side boot on shaft.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install tripod joint (1) on shaft using special tool with hammer, directing its chamfered spline (3) toward wheel side, and then fasten tripod joint with new snap ring (2) using snap ring pliers (4).
</ptxt>
<servicetool>
<servicetoolitem id = "L3A102">
<s-part>
(A)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09925-98221">
09925–98221
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
</servicetool>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "I8G001311014.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "30.306mm" ver = "01" gw = "155" gh = "69"/>
</figure>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "I8C50A311007.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "50.196mm" ver = "01" gw = "189" gh = "125"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Apply grease “A” from the service kit to tripod joint and joint housing (1).
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Grease specification for front drive shaft differential side joint
</title>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1" page = "2">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "1.714in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.714in"/>
<thead>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
Grease color
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
Grease amount
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle" align = "center">
<ptxt>
Tan
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
120 – 140 g
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(4.23 – 4.94 oz)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "I4RS0B310003.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "38.935mm" ver = "01" gw = "191" gh = "93"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Fit boot (1) to grooves of shaft and differential side joint housing (2).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Insert flat-bladed screwdriver or the like into boot and allow air to enter boot so that air pressure in boot becomes the same as atmospheric pressure at boot fixing position.
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Drive shaft boot fixing position (distance between differential side joint end and boot small end)
</title>
