</s1>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
Fasten boot bands using special tool as shown in figure.
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
Squeezing or distorting the boot will reduce its durability.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Do not force air out of the boot by squeezing or distorting it when fastening it with boot bands.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
Big band:
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Fasten boot band (1) by pinching hooks (2) with special tool and engage hooks (3) as shown in figure.
</ptxt>
<servicetool>
<servicetoolitem id = "L3A103">
<s-part>
(A)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09943-57021">
09943–57021
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
</servicetool>
<figure page = "2">
<graphic graphicname = "I8C50A311034.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "76.913mm" ver = "01" gw = "176" gh = "202"/>
</figure>
</item>
</list1>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
Small band:
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Fasten boot band (1) using special tool as shown in figure.
</ptxt>
<servicetool>
<servicetoolitem id = "L3A104">
<s-part>
(B)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09943-57011">
09943–57011
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
</servicetool>
<spec>
<title>
Boot band fastening distance
</title>
<ptxt>
“a”: 1.2 – 4.0 mm (0.04 – 0.15 in.)
</ptxt>
</spec>
<figure page = "2">
<graphic graphicname = "IDL10A311008.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "48.906mm" ver = "01" gw = "190" gh = "122"/>
